<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>MechDragon_EI</defName>
    <label>E-I MechDragon</label>
    <description>It is a walking tank with a dragon-like appearance. It boasts a powerful servo mechanism and heavy armor, and is said to be able to catch the thrust of a centipede-type mechanoid.It seems to have been developed during the prehistoric Mechanoid Wars, but the details are not well known.However, it is well known that they are very friendly and “alive”. If you catch them with the right food, they will gladly join you.</description>
    <statBases>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-100</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>300</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MeatAmount>5</MeatAmount>
      <LeatherAmount>5</LeatherAmount>
      <IncomingDamageFactor>0.9</IncomingDamageFactor>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>1.32</ArmorRating_Blunt>
